PROJECT: Aptos

## System Architecture
- Arsitektur: Layer 1 Blockchain (Monolithic dengan eksekusi paralél) (HIGH) [Aptos Whitepaper, https://aptoslabs.com/whitepaper.pdf; Aptos Dev Docs Architecture, https://aptos.dev/concepts/architecture]
- Deskripsi: Blockchain Layer 1 proof-of-stake dengan lapisan eksekusi (Move VM), konsensus (AptosBFT v4/DiemBFT), dan penyimpanan (State Merkle Tree / Jellyfish Merkle Tree) yang terintegrasi dalam satu client software (aptos-core). (HIGH) [Aptos Whitepaper, https://aptoslabs.com/whitepaper.pdf]
- Pendekatan Skalabilitas: Eksekusi transaksi paralel via Block-STM (Software Transactional Memory) untuk throughput tinggi tanpa sharding. (HIGH) [Aptos Blog Block-STM, https://aptoslabs.com/block-stm; Research Paper Block-STM, https://arxiv.org/abs/2203.06871]

## Core Components
- Nama: Aptos Core (aptos-core) | Fungsi: Client node penuh (Full Node / Validator) yang mengimplementasikan konsensus, eksekusi, storage, mempool, dan networking. Ditulis di Rust. | Status: Active (Development terus berlanjut) (HIGH) [GitHub aptos-core, https://github.com/aptos-labs/aptos-core]
- Nama: Move VM (Move Virtual Machine) | Fungsi: Mesin eksekusi bytecode Move, bertanggung jawab verifikasi bytecode, interpretasi/JIT, dan manajemen resource/global state. | Status: Active (Terintegrasi di aptos-core) (HIGH) [Move VM Source, https://github.com/aptos-labs/aptos-core/tree/main/aptos-move/vm]
- Nama: AptosBFT (Consensus Engine) | Fungsi: Protokol konsensus BFT (berbasis DiemBFT v4 / HotStuff) untuk finalitas cepat (sub-second) dan keamanan asynchronus. | Status: Active (v4 live di Mainnet) (HIGH) [Consensus Source, https://github.com/aptos-labs/aptos-core/tree/main/consensus; Aptos Blog Consensus, https://aptoslabs.com/aptos-consensus]
- Nama: Block-STM (Parallel Execution Engine) | Fungsi: Mesin eksekusi spekulatif paralel yang mendeteksi konflik read/write transaksi dan mengeksekusi ulang transaksi yang bertentangan. | Status: Active (v2 dirilis 2024) (HIGH) [Block-STM Source, https://github.com/aptos-labs/aptos-core/tree/main/block-stm]
- Nama: State Storage (Jellyfish Merkle Tree) | Fungsi: Struktur data Merkle Tree teroptimasi (sparse) untuk penyimpanan state global, mendukung versioning dan proof efisien. | Status: Active (HIGH) [Storage Source, https://github.com/aptos-labs/aptos-core/tree/main/storage]
- Nama: Mempool | Fungsi: Penyimpanan transaksi tertunda prioritas berbasis gas fee, dengan proteksi DoS dan broadcast efisien ke validator lain. | Status: Active (HIGH) [Mempool Source, https://github.com/aptos-labs/aptos-core/tree/main/mempool]
- Nama: State Sync | Fungsi: Protokol sinkronisasi state (full sync, fast sync, continuous sync) untuk node baru atau yang tertinggal. | Status: Active (HIGH) [State Sync Source, https://github.com/aptos-labs/aptos-core/tree/main/state-sync]
- Nama: Indexer / Indexer gRPC | Fungsi: Layanan indeksing data on-chain (events, transactions, account resources) untuk query cepat oleh dApp/explorer via gRPC/GraphQL. | Status: Active (Dikelola terpisah di repo aptos-indexer) (HIGH) [Indexer Repo, https://github.com/aptos-labs/aptos-indexer; Aptos Docs Indexer, https://aptos.dev/indexer]
- Nama: Aptos Explorer (Backend) | Fungsi: Backend visualisasi blok, transaksi, akun, token, dan validator untuk explorer.aptoslabs.com. | Status: Active (HIGH) [Explorer Backend, https://github.com/aptos-labs/aptos-explorer-backend]

## Consensus Mechanism
- Nama: AptosBFT (v4) (HIGH) [Aptos Blog Consensus, https://aptoslabs.com/aptos-consensus]
- Jenis: Byzantine Fault Tolerant (BFT) berbasis HotStuff / DiemBFT (HIGH) [DiemBFT Paper, https://arxiv.org/abs/2003.03094]
- Finalitas: Instan (1-round trip di kondisi synchrony optimal, ~sub-second di praktik) (HIGH) [Aptos Whitepaper, https://aptoslabs.com/whitepaper.pdf]
- Validator Set: Permissionless (Proof-of-Stake), rotasi epoch-based (epoch = 7200 detik / 2 jam) (HIGH) [Aptos Docs Staking, https://aptos.dev/concepts/staking]
- Syarat Validator: Minimum stake (self + delegated) untuk masuk top-N (N=100-150 aktif per epoch, parameter governance) (MEDIUM) [Governance Proposal Validator Set Size, https://governance.aptoslabs.com/]

## Execution Environment
- Lingkungan: Move VM (Custom Bytecode Interpreter dengan JIT compilation opsional) (HIGH) [Move VM Docs, https://move-language.github.io/move/vm/]
- Dukungan Bahasa: Move (Smart Contract Language) (HIGH) [Aptos Move Docs, https://aptos.dev/move/overview]
- Fitur Kunci: Resource-based programming (Linear Logic), Formal Verification (Move Prover), Module Upgradability, Parallel Execution via Block-STM. (HIGH) [Aptos Move Book, https://aptos.dev/move/move-book/]

## Programming Languages
- Rust: Bahasa utama untuk client node (aptos-core), consensus, storage, networking, Move VM implementation. (HIGH) [GitHub aptos-core Languages, https://github.com/aptos-labs/aptos-core]
- Move: Bahasa smart contract (source code) dan bytecode target VM. (HIGH) [Move Language GitHub, https://github.com/move-language/move]
- TypeScript / JavaScript: SDK klien resmi (aptos.ts / @aptos-labs/ts-sdk), tooling CLI, indexing, dan integrasi frontend. (HIGH) [TS SDK Repo, https://github.com/aptos-labs/aptos-ts-sdk]
- Python: SDK klien (aptos-python-sdk), scripting, dan analisis data. (MEDIUM) [Python SDK Repo, https://github.com/aptos-labs/aptos-python-sdk]
- Go: SDK klien (aptos-go-sdk) untuk backend/service. (MEDIUM) [Go SDK Repo, https://github.com/aptos-labs/aptos-go-sdk]
- CLI Tooling: `aptos` CLI (ditulis Rust) untuk deployment, testing, node ops. (HIGH) [CLI Repo, https://github.com/aptos-labs/aptos-cli]

## Development Framework
- Aptos CLI: Tool baris perintah untuk kompilasi Move, deploy, test, key management, node ops. (HIGH) [Aptos CLI Docs, https://aptos.dev/tools/aptos-cli/]
- Move Package Manager: Sistem manajemen dependensi dan build (`Move.toml`, `Sources/`) terintegrasi CLI. (HIGH) [Move Package Docs, https://aptos.dev/move/move-package/]
- Aptos TS SDK (`@aptos-labs/ts-sdk`): SDK generasi baru (v1.0+ 2024) untuk transaksi, query, wallet adapter, transaction simulation. (HIGH) [TS SDK Docs, https://aptos.dev/sdks/ts-sdk/]
- Aptos Python SDK / Go SDK / Rust SDK: SDK bahasa lain untuk integrasi backend. (HIGH) [SDKs Overview, https://aptos.dev/sdks/]
- Move Prover (Formal Verification): Alat verifikasi formal spesifik Move (boogie/z3 backend) untuk membuktikan keamanan kontrak. (HIGH) [Move Prover Docs, https://move-language.github.io/move/prover/]
- Move Analyzer (LSP): Language Server Protocol untuk VS Code (syntax highlight, type check, goto definition). (HIGH) [Move Analyzer Repo, https://github.com/move-language/move-analyzer]
- Aptos Indexer gRPC / GraphQL API: Standar query data on-chain untuk dApp (events, token balances, transaction history). (HIGH) [Indexer API Docs, https://aptos.dev/indexer/]
- Rosetta API: Implementasi standar Coinbase Rosetta untuk integrasi exchange/custodian. (MEDIUM) [Rosetta Repo, https://github.com/aptos-labs/aptos-rosetta]

## Security Model
- Konsensus: AptosBFT (BFT) toleran hingga 1/3 validator byzantine (by stake weight). (HIGH) [Aptos Whitepaper, https://aptoslabs.com/whitepaper.pdf]
- Eksekusi: Move VM resource safety (type safety, resource linearity, no reentrancy by design). (HIGH) [Move Safety Paper, https://move-language.github.io/move/papers/move.pdf]
- Verifikasi Formal: Move Prover untuk verifikasi spesifikasi (invariant, pre/post condition) secara matematis. (HIGH) [Move Prover Docs, https://move-language.github.io/move/prover/]
- Kriptografi: Ed25519 (signature), BLS12-381 (consensus aggregation, randomness), AES-GCM (network encryption), SHA3-256 (hashing). (HIGH) [Crypto Crates, https://github.com/aptos-labs/aptos-core/tree/main/crypto]
- Randomness: On-chain VRF (Verifiable Random Function) native sejak v1.11 (2024) untuk keamanan aplikasi. (HIGH) [AIP-62 / Randomness API, https://github.com/aptos-foundation/AIPs/blob/main/AIPs/aip-62.md]
- Account Abstraction: Native Keyless Accounts (OpenID Connect / WebAuthn) tanpa seed phrase, mendukung multi-sig, social recovery, transaction sponsorship. (HIGH) [Aptos Blog Keyless, https://aptoslabs.com/keyless-accounts]
- Staking/Slashing: Delegated Proof-of-Stake dengan slashing (belum diaktifkan penuh untuk downtime/misbehavior per docs 2024, parameter governance). (MEDIUM) [Staking Docs, https://aptos.dev/concepts/staking; Governance Forum Slashing, https://governance.aptoslabs.com/]

