## Technical Upgrade History
- Tanggal: 2023-02 | Nama Upgrade: v1.1 (DiemBFT v4 Activation) | Deskripsi: Upgrade konsensus ke DiemBFT v4 untuk peningkatan throughput & finalitas. | Status: Completed (Activated via Governance) (HIGH) [GitHub Release v1.1, https://github.com/aptos-labs/aptos-core/releases/tag/v1.1.0]
- Tanggal: 2023-06 | Nama Upgrade: v1.5 / v1.6 | Deskripsi: Resource Groups (storage efficiency), Entry Function ABI improvements, Gas schedule tuning. | Status: Completed (HIGH) [GitHub Release v1.5, https://github.com/aptos-labs/aptos-core/releases/tag/v1.5.0]
- Tanggal: 2023-10 | Nama Upgrade: v1.7 / v1.8 | Deskripsi: Multi-agent transactions, improved event indexing, validator config updates. | Status: Completed (HIGH) [GitHub Release v1.7, https://github.com/aptos-labs/aptos-core/releases/tag/v1.7.0]
- Tanggal: 2024-02 | Nama Upgrade: Fungible Asset (FA) Standard Launch (AIP-21/22) | Deskripsi: Standar token baru menggantikan `0x1::coin`, mendukung metadata, royalty, fungible asset store. | Status: Active (Migration Ongoing) (HIGH) [Aptos Blog FA, https://aptoslabs.com/fungible-asset-standard]
- Tanggal: 2024-04 | Nama Upgrade: v1.9 / v1.10 (Block-STM v2) | Deskripsi: Block-STM v2 dengan paralelisme ditingkatkan, memory overhead reduced, JIT optimization. | Status: Completed (HIGH) [GitHub Release v1.9, https://github.com/aptos-labs/aptos-core/releases/tag/v1.9.0]
- Tanggal: 2024-05 | Nama Upgrade: Keyless Accounts / Account Abstraction (AIP-62) | Deskripsi: Native account abstraction via OpenID Connect (Google, Apple), social recovery, sponsored tx. | Status: Active (HIGH) [Aptos Blog Keyless, https://aptoslabs.com/keyless-accounts]
- Tanggal: 2024-08 | Nama Upgrade: v1.11 (Native Randomness API, Staking Improvements) | Deskripsi: On-chain VRF (Randomness API), stake reward distribution efficiency, validator performance metrics. | Status: Completed (HIGH) [GitHub Release v1.11, https://github.com/aptos-labs/aptos-core/releases/tag/v1.11.0]
- Tanggal: 2024-10 | Nama Upgrade: v1.12 / v1.13 (Planned/Ongoing) | Deskripsi: Continuous performance tuning, Move 2024 edition support, gas schedule updates. | Status: Ongoing (MEDIUM) [GitHub Releases Latest, https://github.com/aptos-labs/aptos-core/releases]

## Current Technical Stack
- Bahasa Inti: Rust (Compiler: stable toolchain, edition 2021) (HIGH) [GitHub aptos-core Cargo.toml, https://github.com/aptos-labs/aptos-core/blob/main/Cargo.toml]
- Build System: Cargo (Rust), Buck2 (Meta build system, digunakan internal Aptos Labs untuk monorepo aptos-core) (MEDIUM) [Buck2 Repo, https://github.com/facebook/buck2; Aptos Core Buck Config, https://github.com/aptos-labs/aptos-core/tree/main/buck2]
- Kriptografi: `aptos-crypto` crate (Ed25519, BLS12-381, SHA3, VRF) (HIGH) [Crypto Crate, https://github.com/aptos-labs/aptos-core/tree/main/crypto]
- Networking: `aptos-network` (yamux, noise protocol, QUIC/TCP transport) (HIGH) [Network Crate, https://github.com/aptos-labs/aptos-core/tree/main/network]
- Database: RocksDB (Embedded key-value store untuk state & ledger) (HIGH) [Storage Crate, https://github.com/aptos-labs/aptos-core/tree/main/storage]
- Serialisasi: BCS (Binary Canonical Serialization) / Serde (HIGH) [BCS Crate, https://github.com/aptos-labs/aptos-core/tree/main/bcs]
- Container/Orchestration: Docker (Official images di Docker Hub `aptoslabs/validator`, `aptoslabs/fullnode`), Kubernetes (Helm charts untuk deployment validator/node di cloud). (HIGH) [Docker Hub Aptos, https://hub.docker.com/u/aptoslabs; Kubernetes Helm, https://github.com/aptos-labs/aptos-core/tree/main/docker/helm]
- Cloud Provider Integration: Google Cloud Blockchain Node Engine, AWS Managed Blockchain (AMB), Ankr, QuickNode, NodeReal (RPC Providers). (HIGH) [Aptos Docs Infrastructure, https://aptos.dev/nodes/]
- CI/CD: GitHub Actions (Testing, Build, Release automation di aptos-core). (HIGH) [GitHub Actions Workflows, https://github.com/aptos-labs/aptos-core/tree/main/.github/workflows]
- Monitoring: Prometheus / Grafana (Metrics endpoint standar di node), OpenTelemetry support. (HIGH) [Monitoring Docs, https://aptos.dev/nodes/monitoring/]

## Known Technical Limitations
- Keterbatasan: Slashing (penalti stake untuk misbehavior/downtime) belum sepenuhnya diaktifkan/dienforce pada lapisan protokol utama per dokumentasi staking terbaru (hanya reward distribution aktif). (MEDIUM) [Staking Docs, https://aptos.dev/concepts/staking; Governance Discussion Slashing, https://governance.aptoslabs.com/]
- Keterbatasan: Throughput aktual mainnet (real-world TPS) jauh di bawah teoritis Block-STM (100k+ TPS lab) karena bottleneck I/O RocksDB, networking, dan gas limit per blok. (HIGH) [Aptos Explorer Metrics, https://explorer.aptoslabs.com/; Aptos Blog Performance Realities, https://aptoslabs.com/block-stm-v2]
- Keterbatasan: Ukuran state growth (State Bloat) menjadi tantangan jangka panjang untuk full node hardware requirements (RAM/SSD), belum ada state expiry/history expiry native terimplementasi (masih riset/roadmap). (MEDIUM) [Aptos Foundation Research Grants State Expiry, https://aptosfoundation.org/grants]
- Keterbatasan: Kompatibilitas Move Bytecode versi lama (Move 2019/2020 edition) memerlukan migrasi ke Move 2024 edition; tooling migration masih manual bagi developer kontrak lama. (MEDIUM) [Move 2024 Edition Blog, https://aptoslabs.com/move-2024-edition]
- Keterbatasan: Cross-chain messaging (Wormhole, LayerZero) bergantung pada keamanan validator/relayer pihak ketiga (DVN/Guardian), bukan native trust-minimized bridging (seperti IBC light client). (HIGH) [Wormhole Docs, https://docs.wormhole.com/; LayerZero Docs, https://layerzero.gitbook.io/docs/]

