## RINGKASAN
- Architecture: Layer 1 Monolithic, Parallel Execution (Block-STM), Move VM, PoS (AptosBFT)
- Core Components: 9 (Aptos Core, Move VM, AptosBFT, Block-STM, Jellyfish Merkle Storage, Mempool, State Sync, Indexer, Explorer Backend)
- Audit Count: 7 Auditor Utama (OtterSec, Trail of Bits, CertiK, Halborn, Zellic, Spearbit, Quantstamp) dengan banyak laporan per auditor.
- Major Upgrade Count: 8 Upgrade Protokol Mayor (v1.1, v1.5/1.6, v1.7/1.8, FA Standard, v1.9/1.10 Block-STM v2, Keyless/AA, v1.11 Randomness, v1.12+ Ongoing).

## Open Threads
- Detail spesifik parameter slashing (downtime threshold, double-sign penalty) dan timeline aktivasi on-chain belum final/diverifikasi dari proposal governance terbaru.
- Status implementasi "State Expiry" / "History Expiry" untuk mengatasi state bloat: apakah sudah ada AIP formal atau masih tahap riset grant.
- Benchmark performa Block-STM v2 di mainnet production (TPS aktual, latency p99, CPU/Mem validator) vs angka lab teoritis.
- Detail arsitektur "Move 2024 Edition" migration path bagi kontrak deployed pre-2024 (kompatibilitas bytecode verifier).
- Spesifik teknis Keyless Accounts: dukungan WebAuthn (Passkeys) di mobile browser (iOS Safari/Android Chrome) status implementasi lengkap.
- Daftar lengkap "Gas Schedule" parameter saat ini (cost per opcode, storage read/write, entry function) untuk analisis ekonomi transaksi.
- Status integrasi IBC (Inter-Blockchain Communication) light client di Aptos (masih proposal/riset vs live).